Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: remote-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9)
Description: Pure-Python shared-PTY terminal for bench RE work
 Frank and an agent attach to the same PTY session over a Unix domain
 socket -- no tmux/screen dependency, no copy-paste/screenshot round trip.
 `remote-cli serve` runs the shared daemon; `remote-cli attach` joins it
 from a human terminal; the control socket (exec/snapshot/send/logs ops)
 is what an MCP wrapper (plugins/limpet-plugin-remote-cli) drives.
